{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1266.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f2274d47cac08fb6d795c6d222225a27fb14aae5b06a295c814f629da0bd13d6","ja":"今日のお仕事はPV撮影。\nみんなは衣装に着替えて出番を待っていて……","zh":"今天的工作是拍摄PV。\n大家换好了服装，正等待登场……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1266.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"bd0e1459854f7755d05953dc3770fcf50502ac6a549ad30c509bb9c6c95288bb","ja":"あ、風花ちゃん、千鶴ちゃん。\n貴音ちゃん見なかった？","zh":"啊，风花、千鹤。\n看到贵音了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1266.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"86653411ccdb7fd350bfe37ccf6b065dc64f452989a9c6384f632c3de5da7157","ja":"貴音ちゃん……ですか？\nいえ、ちょっと分からないですね……。","zh":"贵音……吗？\n不，我不太清楚呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1266.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7db583a752bef7aa5eb791c6a877d6f4de53893c9b4f4bc416b8160e8afc7607","ja":"わたくしも見ていませんわ。\nどうかしましたの？","zh":"我也没有看到呢。\n发生什么事了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1266.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"98b80908b904443e781c1c1fa3fcf9658fb176c339054ab5d3b6e45f4d55d917","ja":"そろそろ貴音ちゃんのソロ撮影の出番だから\n声をかけようと思ったんだけど、見当たらなくって。","zh":"差不多到贵音个人拍摄的轮次了，\n我本想去叫她一声，却到处都没找着。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1266.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ff18305b0f4467dd714c19cfac51680f81e79f58d8f4b111df47343b036bc6f2","ja":"携帯は私服と一緒に、\n置きっぱなしになってたし……。","zh":"手机也和便服放在一起，\n一直没拿……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1266.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"0690f2006fcec167d3ba09f53c9dea28d67c5264dea59ee1d09ee5e89d378368","ja":"それは心配ですわね……。","zh":"那真是令人担心呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1266.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"5474b2472aca4a6c19abd8f0ae8130665d955792de53ccbff57b51e9bf29a3ee","ja":"ええ……。\nそれじゃあ、私は他の場所を探してみるわね。","zh":"嗯……\n那我去其他地方找找看吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1266.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3213a5e116dd2f5bc61f40e7ba61ac1fff18a8106f56903fbdb194872f0ea72b","ja":"貴音ちゃん、どこに行っちゃったのかしら？","zh":"贵音去哪里了呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1266.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9e9499ca1d93bd53e178d241bb726add3b0d34ed937b6652cc40bb768b4c44cf","ja":"遅れるとスタッフの方にもご迷惑ですし、\nわたくし達も、探してみましょう。","zh":"要是迟到也会给工作人员添麻烦，\n我们也来找找看吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
